Republic Day of India | is_a=national day | occurs_when=the twenty-sixth of January comes round | means=the day the Constitution of India came into force
Tricolour | is_a=national flag | located_in=India | has_part=Ashoka Chakra | has_property=saffron, white and green bands
Ashoka Chakra | is_a=symbol | part_of=Tricolour | means=a twenty-four spoked wheel standing for the law of righteousness
Jana Gana Mana | is_a=national anthem | located_in=India | author=Rabindranath Tagore
