# --- the constitution and the state --------------------------------------------------------------------- #
Constitution of India | is_a=constitution | purpose=setting out how India is governed and what rights citizens hold | has_property=the longest written constitution of any sovereign country | author=Constituent Assembly of India | has_part=Fundamental Rights | has_part=Directive Principles
B R Ambedkar | is_a=jurist | is_a=social reformer | purpose=chairing the drafting committee of the Constitution of India | birthplace=Mhow
Fundamental Rights | is_a=part of a constitution | located_in=the Constitution of India | purpose=guaranteeing rights the state may not take away | has_kind=right to equality | has_kind=right to freedom | has_kind=right against exploitation
Directive Principles | is_a=part of a constitution | purpose=setting goals the state should work toward | has_property=not enforceable in a court
Parliament of India | is_a=parliament | has_part=Lok Sabha | has_part=Rajya Sabha | purpose=making the laws of India
Lok Sabha | is_a=legislative chamber | part_of=Parliament of India | means=the house whose members are elected directly by the people | has_property=the lower house
Rajya Sabha | is_a=legislative chamber | part_of=Parliament of India | means=the house representing the states | has_property=the upper house
President of India | is_a=office | purpose=the head of state | has_property=elected by an electoral college | has_property=acts on the advice of the council of ministers
Prime Minister of India | is_a=office | purpose=the head of government | requires=the confidence of the Lok Sabha
Chief Justice of India | is_a=office | purpose=heading the Supreme Court of India
Supreme Court of India | is_a=court | purpose=the highest court of appeal and the guardian of the Constitution | located_in=New Delhi
Election Commission of India | is_a=institution | purpose=conducting elections free of the government of the day
Reserve Bank of India | is_a=central bank | purpose=issuing currency and setting monetary policy | located_in=Mumbai
Panchayati Raj | is_a=system of government | means=elected self government at village, block and district level | purpose=deciding local matters locally
ISRO | is_a=agency | purpose=India's space programme | located_in=Bengaluru | involves=Chandrayaan | involves=Mangalyaan
Chandrayaan | is_a=space mission | purpose=exploring the Moon | involves=ISRO
Mangalyaan | is_a=space mission | purpose=orbiting Mars | involves=ISRO | also_known_as=Mars Orbiter Mission

